 ing shops in the downtown warehouse district hand out fresh holiday cooki
 es for the Cookie Crawl. The Great Christmas Pickle Hunt follows on Sunda
 y. Time: Fri 4 PM to 6 PM with Santa at the Chamber\; Sat Cookie Crawl du
